# Environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env` for local development:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# The base template has no required variables. As you add features, declare
# keys in src/env.ts and import them from $app/env/private or $app/env/public.
# Document every key here with a non-empty placeholder value.
# Supply values needed during build in CI too. After adding or changing
# keys, run `pnpm sync` to regenerate the SvelteKit env types.
#
# Example (uncomment and adapt when you add a database):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/app
